# SHADOW VEIL — Chapter V: The Mirror Province

scene intro
  lock
  fade 1 0
  letterbox 1 0
  player face right
  player pose stand
  music silent
  camera player 3 -2 1.2 0
  wait 0.8
  narrate "Past the end of Hakuro's road, the land goes quiet. Lakes hold two skies. Houses stand in the water's reflection that do not stand on the shore."
  narrate "This is the Mirror Province, where the Veil wears thinnest."
  fade 0 3.0 nowait
  wait 1.6
  camera player 10 -3 0.9 3 nowait
  say REI "Odaka came this way. The tracks just… stop at the water."
  wait 0.6
  flash 0.4 ffe0a0
  ripple player 1.2
  say SAYO "Rei."
  say REI "…Who's there?"
  say SAYO "Don't be afraid. I can only reach you here, where the weave is thin. Take this thread. Hold it when you move, and you'll step through to the other side."
  say SAYO "Hurry. My brother is coming, and he means to cut me loose."
  flag mirror_thread
  toast "Weaver's Thread" "Dash to step between the Bright side and the Hollow side."
  camera player 3 -2 1.0 1.5
  title "第五章" "Chapter V — The Mirror Province" 4.5
  letterbox 0 1.2
  camera_release
  unlock
  hint layers
  request save
end

scene crossing
  lock
  letterbox 1 0.8
  camera npc:m_exile -2 -1 1.05 2
  say EXILE "A Kagenui who walks both sides. The ferryman said one would come."
  say REI "You live here? Between them?"
  say EXILE "We live on the Hollow side, in the reflection. You've been walking past our doors since the shore."
  say EXILE "Kagami guards the crossing. Your old man in straw went over it four days ago, and she couldn't stop him. She won't be in the mood to talk."
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.8
  unlock
  request save
end

scene mirror_exile
  say EXILE "My mother told me the Weaver sings at night. You can hear it on the Hollow side if the lake is very still."
  say EXILE "She's sung the same song for twenty years. A lullaby."
end

scene ferryman_talk
  say FERRYMAN "I row both ways, child. Exiles out, sometimes. Letters in, more often."
  say FERRYMAN "Twenty years ago I rowed a young woman across to the Heart. She left a baby with her brother on the shore. She said she would be back by spring."
  say FERRYMAN "I've waited at this shore every spring since."
end

scene boss_intro
  lock
  letterbox 1 1.0
  music silent
  camera boss -4 -1 1.0 2.2
  wait 0.4
  say KAGAMI "Another stitcher. The first one walked through me like I was rain."
  say REI "Odaka. Where did he go?"
  say KAGAMI "To the Heart, where the Weaver holds the Veil. He carries a needle that can cut any thread."
  say KAGAMI "If he cuts her loose all at once, the Veil tears from end to end. Both sides fall into each other. My people with them."
  say REI "Then let me through, and I'll stop him."
  say KAGAMI "I let the last Kagenui through. Show me you're stronger than he is, or go home."
  sfx perilous
  shake 0.4
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.8
  unlock
  boss_start
  hint mirror
end

scene boss_phase2
  lock
  letterbox 1 0.4
  camera boss 0 -1 1.1 0.6
  say KAGAMI "Good. Now the other side of the glass."
  flash 0.4 e8dcff
  wait 0.4
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.4
  unlock
end

scene boss_outro
  lock
  letterbox 1 1.0
  music elegy
  wait 1.4
  camera boss 0 -1 1.3 2.2
  say KAGAMI "…You stopped. He didn't stop. He walked straight through."
  say REI "I didn't come to beat you. I came to get past you."
  say KAGAMI "Then go past me. And listen to me, stitcher: the Weaver's name is Sayo."
  say KAGAMI "She went into the Heart twenty years ago, when the Veil began to fail. She has been holding it closed with her own hands ever since."
  say KAGAMI "Odaka is her brother. He has waited twenty years to bring her out."
  say REI "…Sayo."
  say REI "The ferryman said she left a baby on the shore."
  say KAGAMI "Yes. With her brother. He raised it as a Kagenui."
  wait 1.2
  say REI "…"
  say KAGAMI "Take my mask. In the Heart, it will let you see the threads as she sees them."
  toast "Mirror Mask" "Token acquired"
  wait 0.6
  narrate "Rei stood at the edge of the still mere for a long time. Then she walked out onto the water, and the water held."
  wait 0.6
  fade 1 2.5
  wait 0.4
  request chapter_end
end

scene mirror_awaken
  lock
  letterbox 1 0.5
  slowmo 0.4 1.2
  camera player 0 -1 1.3 1.0
  flash 0.4 e8dcff
  ripple player 1.0
  wait 0.6
  say REI "Leave a reflection where you stood. Let them strike the glass."
  toast "Mirror Stance awakened" "Dashing leaves a mirror image behind. Foes strike at it, and it takes a shot meant for you."
  hint mirror
  camera_release
  letterbox 0 0.5
  unlock
  request save
end
